<div id="mw-aria-live-region" class="mw-aria-live-region" aria-live="polite"></div><div class="mw-body" role="main">
	<h1 id="firstHeading">Résultat de l’API de MediaWiki</h1>
	<div class="mw-body-content">
		<div id="mw-content-text" class="mw-body-content"><div class="api-pretty-header"><p>Voici la représentation HTML du format JSON. HTML convient au débogage, mais est inapproprié pour être utilisé dans une application.
</p><p>Spécifiez le paramètre <var>format</var> pour modifier le format de sortie. Pour voir la représentation non HTML du format JSON, mettez <a class="external text" href="https://www.wikidata.org/w/api.php?action=wbsearchentities&amp;format=json&amp;language=fr&amp;limit=20&amp;search=Nicolas+Joray&amp;uselang=fr"><kbd>format=json</kbd></a>.
</p><p>Voir la <a href="https://www.mediawiki.org/wiki/API" class="extiw" title="mw:API">documentation complète</a>, ou l’<a href="/w/api.php?action=help&amp;modules=main">aide de l’API</a> pour plus d’informations.
</p></div><div class="api-pretty-content mw-highlight mw-highlight-lang-javascript mw-content-ltr" dir="ltr"><pre><span></span><span class="p">{</span>
<span class="w">    </span><span class="s2">"error"</span><span class="o">:</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="p">{</span>
<span class="w">        </span><span class="s2">"code"</span><span class="o">:</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="s2">"badvalue"</span><span class="p">,</span>
<span class="w">        </span><span class="s2">"info"</span><span class="o">:</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="s2">"Unrecognized value for parameter \"format\": 1."</span><span class="p">,</span>
<span class="w">        </span><span class="s2">"*"</span><span class="o">:</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="s2">"See https://www.wikidata.org/w/api.php for API usage. Subscribe to the mediawiki-api-announce mailing list at &amp;lt;https://lists.wikimedia.org/postorius/lists/mediawiki-api-announce.lists.wikimedia.org/&amp;gt; for notice of API deprecations and breaking changes."</span>
<span class="w">    </span><span class="p">},</span>
<span class="w">    </span><span class="s2">"servedby"</span><span class="o">:</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="s2">"mw-api-ext.codfw.main-7f67887c55-h9glc"</span>
<span class="p">}</span>
